@fn parse_args
@purpose Parse argc/argv into an Options struct; validate flags; map the first non-flag to a command; collect remaining as files.
@pre args[0] sentinel, args[1] program name, args[2..] user args. [src: main.aria:130-131]
@post Options populated; files defaulted to [""] if none; format validated to "text" or "json"; has_error set on validation failure. [src: main.aria:176]
@complexity O(n) single pass. [src: main.aria:125-177]
@thread_safety immutable.
@antipatterns Flag parsing is a chain of ~11 startsWith checks — vulnerable to typos and hard to extend. [src: main.aria:134-166]

