@fn resolve_stdlib_files
@purpose Scan inputs for `use <module>` and auto-include matching stdlib .aria files.
@post Returns the additional files to prepend; tracks dedup via seen[]. [src: main.aria:497]
@complexity O(n * m * s) — nested scan of files x modules x seen. [src: main.aria:464-495]
@thread_safety not-safe — reads lib/ and $ARIA_HOME/lib/. [src: main.aria:458, main.aria:479-490]
@antipatterns Falls back to $ARIA_HOME/lib only if $ARIA_HOME differs from the hard-coded default — dev setups without the env var fail without a clear message. [src: main.aria:483]

