@fn resolve_local_modules
@purpose BFS closure over `use <local_module>` declarations; transitively include sibling module directories.
@post Returns additional files from all transitive module dirs; avoids cycles via seen[]. [src: main.aria:576]
@complexity O(f * m * d * log d + q) where q = BFS queue size.
@thread_safety not-safe — Fs.
@antipatterns BFS scans the entire transitive closure eagerly — no lazy loading or module-level caching. [src: main.aria:544-574]

