@fn run_check
@purpose Type-check without codegen. Reports diagnostics in text or JSON. Exit 0 = clean, 1 = errors.
@pre raw_files non-empty; files readable. [src: main.aria:802-806]
@post Diagnostics printed; 0 or 1 returned. [src: main.aria:822]
@complexity O(n) linear through the compile phases. [src: main.aria:802-823]
@thread_safety not-safe — Fs + Io.
@antipatterns No parallel checking, no incremental cache — every invocation rechecks everything. [src: main.aria:817-821]

